 ## ARCHITECTURE DESCRIPTION:
 The `PhantomWikiReActPipeline` (entry point) initialises three components: (1) a `CountingRM` wrapper around a remote ColBERTv2 server for call-count telemetry; (2) a `dspy.LM` backed by `openai/gpt-5.4-nano` with `reasoning_effort="low"` and caching disabled; (3) a `PhantomWikiReAct` sub-module. In `forward()`, both the LM and RM are injected into DSPy's thread-local context and the question is forwarded to `PhantomWikiReAct`.
 
