-Data flow: `question` (str) → `PhantomWikiReActPipeline.forward` → `PhantomWikiReAct.forward` → Pass 1 ReAct loop (≤75 iters, 5 tools) → Pass 2 ReAct loop (≤60 iters, 5 tools, sees pass-1 answers) → deduplicated merge → `dspy.Prediction(answer: list[str])`.
